# The champion with the turtle armed and the riposte behind it (turtle
# 85, riposte 1): the same one-shot read at sample 1,500 -- at or below
# 85 percent of the strongest rival's worth the army holds home, no
# wave releasing on size -- with the counter-punch the hold exists for:
# the moment an intrusion inside our outpost radius ENDS, the whole
# reserve releases as one wave and runs to its break before the hold
# resumes. The human play the community corpus ranks first against the
# shipped AI: let the attack burn on the defences, then push into the
# window before the next group finishes staging (ai-opponent-strategy).
# The sibling evolve1-g4m2-turtle85 holds without ever punching, so the
# pair separates the hold's own worth from the counter's. Built from the
# certified 96-game corpus (very-hard-race, log 2026-09-13). Every other
# knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
